    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >picoCAD is a 3D modelling tool that lets you make low poly models with a unique aesthetic,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused toolset</strong>: Create retro-style models without any prior experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in texture editor</strong>: See your pixel art appear on model as you draw it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique aesthetic</strong>: Embrace the charm of low-poly, low-res visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GIF export</strong>: Instantly share animations on social media</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OBJ export</strong>: Bring your models into any modern game engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community-driven</strong>: Join a helpful and friendly Discord full of creators. Together de decide which features to do next</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/fe5fdcc9676253055594f61d53bc071b.poster.avif?t=1748894890\" width=192 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/fe5fdcc9676253055594f61d53bc071b.webm?t=1748894890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/fe5fdcc9676253055594f61d53bc071b.mp4?t=1748894890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/9d6d89bff174dd0a77491751a727c28d.poster.avif?t=1748894890\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/9d6d89bff174dd0a77491751a727c28d.gif?t=1748894890\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/e907203e9476943fee1f36757032e396.poster.avif?t=1748894890\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/e907203e9476943fee1f36757032e396.gif?t=1748894890\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S NEW?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-written from scratch, picoCAD 2 offers a lot of improvements over the original. Think NES to SNES. Here are some highlights:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No project size limits</strong>: Build as big (or small) as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New texture editor</strong>: Fully integrated with your workflow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Per-pixel depth sorting</strong>: Clean visuals with no z-fighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Palette and shading editors</strong>: Fine-tune your color ramps and lighting style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mesh visibility toggles</strong>: Hide/show parts of your model as needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom GIF settings</strong>: Control resolution, duration, and loop style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refined interface</strong>: Better layout, fonts, and readability</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >picoCAD is a 3D modelling tool that lets you make low poly models with a unique aesthetic,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused toolset</strong>: Create retro-style models without any prior experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in texture editor</strong>: See your pixel art appear on model as you draw it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique aesthetic</strong>: Embrace the charm of low-poly, low-res visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GIF export</strong>: Instantly share animations on social media</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OBJ export</strong>: Bring your models into any modern game engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community-driven</strong>: Join a helpful and friendly Discord full of creators. Together de decide which features to do next</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/fe5fdcc9676253055594f61d53bc071b.poster.avif?t=1748894890\" width=192 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/fe5fdcc9676253055594f61d53bc071b.webm?t=1748894890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/fe5fdcc9676253055594f61d53bc071b.mp4?t=1748894890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/9d6d89bff174dd0a77491751a727c28d.poster.avif?t=1748894890\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/9d6d89bff174dd0a77491751a727c28d.gif?t=1748894890\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/e907203e9476943fee1f36757032e396.poster.avif?t=1748894890\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/e907203e9476943fee1f36757032e396.gif?t=1748894890\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S NEW?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-written from scratch, picoCAD 2 offers a lot of improvements over the original. Think NES to SNES. Here are some highlights:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No project size limits</strong>: Build as big (or small) as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New texture editor</strong>: Fully integrated with your workflow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Per-pixel depth sorting</strong>: Clean visuals with no z-fighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Palette and shading editors</strong>: Fine-tune your color ramps and lighting style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mesh visibility toggles</strong>: Hide/show parts of your model as needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom GIF settings</strong>: Control resolution, duration, and loop style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refined interface</strong>: Better layout, fonts, and readability</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
